# Deferred: other-user Wardrobes sheet item counts

**Status:** Revisit later. Do not implement unless the user asks.

## Gap

Own-profile Wardrobes sheet subtitles include item counts (`Closet · N items` via `wardrobeSubtitle(for:)`).

Other-user Wardrobes sheet (`remoteWardrobePage`) only shows type (`Closet` / `Wishlist`) — no item count.

## Intended parity

When ready, match own-profile subtitle style for each remote wardrobe row (type · item count). Likely needs a count from visible wardrobe items (cached grid fetch, or an RPC/field on `get_visible_wardrobes`).
